{
    "title": "Comikey - Manga & Webcomics",
    "description": "Manga, Manhua, Manhwa, and Webtoons! Unlock a whole new world of comics with Comikey! Comikey is a free app for reading all of your favorite comics in English. Read Simulpub chapters of officially licensed comics, support creators and publishers by reading your favorite series on Comikey. Don\u2019t want to pay? No worries! Read nearly our entire catalog for FREE by watching ads!\r\n\r\nDiscover new free stories to binge every day, with every genre from action, romance to isekai!\r\n\r\n\u2022 <b>Read free</b> by watching ads, daily\r\n\u2022 <b>Exclusive manga and webtoons</b> you won\u2019t find anywhere else\r\n\u2022 <b>High-quality</b> manga translations\r\n\u2022 Plenty of access: Chapters can be unlocked using your <b>free daily pass</b>, by <b>watching ads</b>, and of course, by using your keys to support the creators!\r\n\r\nTired of inconsistent releases? On Comikey, translations of manga, webtoons, and manhwa are high-quality and officially licensed, so you can support your favorite authors and artists! Here are just a few stories you can start binging today:\r\nGet your kicks with <b>hardcore action</b> like \u201cKengan Omega\u201d, \u201cKengan Ashura\u201d,  \u201cStrike it Rich\u201d, \u201cRecord of Ragnarok\u201d, \u201cBattle in 5 Seconds\u201d, \u201cBattle in 5 Seconds\u201d, and more!\r\nBe reborn into new worlds with <b>isekai</b> series like \u201cHappy Harem Making with the Mightiest Orc!\u201d, \u201cThe Strongest Savior's Second Chance\u201d, and more!\r\nLaugh along with <b>comedy</b> reads like \u201cPlace of Her Way\u201d, \u201cAsobi Asobase\u201d, and more!\r\nFeel the <b>thrill</b> with \u201cCastration: Rebirth\u201d, \u201cPanagia\u2019s Territory\u201d, \u201cFacelift Game\u201d, and more!\r\nGet a little <b>slice of life</b> with \u201cReptile Secrets\u201d, \u201cA Cursed Sword\u2019s Daily Life\u201d, and more!\r\nFeel butterflies with <b>romance</b> like \u201cFirefly Wedding\u201d, \u201cSmoking Behind the Supermarket with You\u201d, \u201cMy Awkward Senpai\u201d, \u201cThe Ice Guy and His Cool Female Colleague\u201d, \u201cThe Girl I Like Forgot Her Glasses\u201d, and more!\r\nWatch two girls\u2019 journey to becoming <b>K-pop</b> idols in \u201cGirl Crush\u201d.\r\nHome of original versions of anime and drama adaptations, like \u201cAsobi Asobase\u201d.\r\n\r\nPartnerships with Shogakukan\u2019s MangaOne division, Hakusensha, SQUARE ENIX, Coamix, Compass, Manhuatai, Kanman Manhua, Kuaikan Comics, and Shinchosha gives you exclusive access to translated webtoons and manga that you only find on Comikey!\r\n\r\nFollow us for the latest updates:\r\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/comikey.media/ \r\nTikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@comikey.media \r\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/Comikeymedia \r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/comikey \r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://comikey.com/privacy/ \r\nTerms of Use: https://comikey.com/tos/",
